1
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:06,000
A crack in the world has started... we have 24 hours to stop it.

2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
MegaFault is a tv movie, action, adventure film directed by David Michael Latt.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
When miner Charley 'Boomer' Baxter sets off a series of massive mining detonations in West Virginia, a gigantic earthquake is soon
rocking the North Atlantic, exposing a deep seismic fault that runs the length of the North American continent.

4
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
Joining forces with government seismology expert Dr Amy Lane, Boomer must now race against time to
stop the chasm that is threatening to tear America - and the entire world - in half.

5
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
Dr. Amy Lane, played by Brittany Murphy.

6
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
Charley 'Boomer' Baxter, played by Eriq La Salle.

7
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:06,000
Major Boyd Grayson, played by Paul Logan.

8
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:06,000
Dr. Mark Rhodes, played by Bruce Davison.

9
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
Dan Lane, played by Justin Hartley.

10
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
Sebastian, played by Jack Goldenberg.

11
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
MegaFault is a 2009 television disaster film by The Asylum, directed by David Michael Latt, starring
Brittany Murphy, Justin Hartley, Eriq Lasalle, Tamala Jones, Paul Logan and Bruce Davison.

12
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
It is one of the last films to feature Brittany Murphy, as
she died a few weeks after its premiere.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
On Italy's CPOP, the movie is listed as the sixth
best Tsunami Disaster Film movie.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
However, the movie received a severely negative reception from many viewers, critics and fansites,
declaring it one of, if not the worst Disaster Movies to have ever been released.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
With Collider saying it is the third worst Disaster Film ever made.

16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
The film explores themes of earthquake, end of the
world, hitchhiker, destruction, military.

17
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
The tone is thought_provoking.
